  {
    "@id": "https://www.tofinotheatre.com/events/an-evening-with-dakota-kieran",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An Evening With Dakota & Kieran | CSCTA"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p></p><p>Born In Victoria, B.C. on the side of the Pacific. His folk guitar and profound voice are reminiscent of the stormy days near the sea; the wet sand grasping to our feet like his music in our head. The songs of Kieran Campbell are denuded from more than what’s necessary and this simplicity serves the truths of his text. </p><p></p><p>Hailing from the heart of old town Toronto, Dakota is a vocalist and electric guitar enthusiast. Her style operates at opposite ends of emotional extremes with ease, switching between a gentle, intimate tone &amp; louder, more passionate rock-influence sound seamlessly to create an experience that makes you want to be present and join in on the powerful but vulnerable performance. Her setlist features an eclectic collection of covers that she reinvents to her own sound.</p><p></p>"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c604d1_2694c07451ec4998bfb2bb064ae2a02b~mv2.jpeg/v1/fill/w_2122,h_1108,al_c,q_90/c604d1_2694c07451ec4998bfb2bb064ae2a02b~mv2.jpeg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:width": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2122"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image:height": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "1108"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://www.tofinotheatre.com/events/an-evening-with-dakota-kieran"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#site_name": [
      {
